<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE V: </span>DINO-WM Hyperparameters</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S8.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S8.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S8.SS1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">HJ Reachability Analysis. </span> To solve the latent fixed-point safety Bellman equation, we adopt DDPG <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib35" title="" class="ltx_ref">35</a>]</cite> within an off-policy, model-based reinforcement learning framework, using the implementation from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib38" title="" class="ltx_ref">38</a>]</cite><span id="footnote5" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">5</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">5</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">5</span>
              
              
              
            <a href="https://github.com/jamesjingqili/Lipschitz_Continuous_Reachability_Learning" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/jamesjingqili/Lipschitz_Continuous_Reachability_Learning</a></span></span></span>. We model the safety value function as a latent-action value function conditioned on the constraint representation <math id="S8.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q(z,a;z_{c})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q(z,a;z_{c})</annotation></semantics></math>. The safety policy is parameterized by an actor-network <math id="S8.SS1.p3.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="a=\pi^{\text{\tiny{\faIcon[*]{shield-alt}}}}(\cdot\mid z,z_{c})\in[-1,1]^{d_{\text{action}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mtext class="fas fa-shield-alt">
<span class="ltx_inline-block fas fa-shield-alt">
</span></mtext></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>action</mtext></msub></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a=\pi^{\text{\tiny{\faIcon[*]{shield-alt}}}}(\cdot\mid z,z_{c})\in[-1,1]^{d_{\text{action}}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the safety value is evaluated by <math id="S8.SS1.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{V^{\text{\tiny{\faIcon[*]{shield-alt}}}}}(z)=\max_{a}Q(z,a;z_{c})=Q(z,\pi^{\text{\tiny{\faIcon[*]{shield-alt}}}}(z,z_{c}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mtext class="fas fa-shield-alt">
<span class="ltx_inline-block fas fa-shield-alt">
</span></mtext></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mtext class="fas fa-shield-alt">
<span class="ltx_inline-block fas fa-shield-alt">
</span></mtext></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{V^{\text{\tiny{\faIcon[*]{shield-alt}}}}}(z)=\max_{a}Q(z,a;z_{c})=Q(z,\pi^{\text{\tiny{\faIcon[*]{shield-alt}}}}(z,z_{c}))</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="S8.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Each trajectory starts from random initial states with randomly sampled constraint representations. The replay buffer <math id="S8.SS1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{B}</annotation></semantics></math> then stores transitions of the form <math id="S8.SS1.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(z,z_{c},a,\tilde{l},z^{\prime})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>l</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(z,z_{c},a,\tilde{l},z^{\prime})</annotation></semantics></math>. The safety filter is optimized using the following objectives:</p>
<table id="S8.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S8.E9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S8.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{L}_{\text{critic}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>critic</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{L}_{\text{critic}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S8.E9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle:=\mathbb{E}_{\mathcal{B}}\left[\left(Q(z,a;z_{c})-y\right)^{2}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle:=\mathbb{E}_{\mathcal{B}}\left[\left(Q(z,a;z_{c})-y\right)^{2}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S8.E10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S8.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle y</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S8.E10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(1-\gamma)\,\tilde{l}+\gamma\min\{\tilde{l},\max_{a^{\prime}}Q(z^{\prime},a^{\prime};z_{c})\}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>l</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>l</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(1-\gamma)\,\tilde{l}+\gamma\min\{\tilde{l},\max_{a^{\prime}}Q(z^{\prime},a^{\prime};z_{c})\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S8.E11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S8.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{L}_{\text{actor}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>actor</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{L}_{\text{actor}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S8.E11.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle:=\mathbb{E}_{z\sim\mathcal{B}}\left[-Q(z,{a};z_{c})\right],\quad{a}=\pi^{\text{\tiny{\faIcon[*]{shield-alt}}}}(\cdot\mid z,z_{c})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo lspace="0em">=</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mtext class="fas fa-shield-alt">
<span class="ltx_inline-block fas fa-shield-alt">
</span></mtext></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle:=\mathbb{E}_{z\sim\mathcal{B}}\left[-Q(z,{a};z_{c})\right],\quad{a}=\pi^{\text{\tiny{\faIcon[*]{shield-alt}}}}(\cdot\mid z,z_{c}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S8.SS1.p4.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="S8.SS1.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math> is scheduled from <math id="S8.SS1.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.85" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.85</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.85</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="S8.SS1.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.9999" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.9999</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.9999</annotation></semantics></math>. The hyperparameters for training DDPG are summarized in Table. <a href="#S8.T6" title="TABLE VI ‣ VIII-A Implementation Details ‣ VIII Appendix ‣ AnySafe: Adapting Latent Safety Filters at Runtime via Safety Constraint Parameterization in the Latent Space" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">VI</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S8.T6" class="ltx_table">
<div id="S8.T6.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:276.0pt;height:197.3pt;vertical-align:-95.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(28.1pt,-20.1pt) scale(1.25518166508185,1.25518166508185) ;">
<table id="S8.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S8.T6.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S8.T6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;"><span id="S8.T6.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">Hyperparameter</span></th>
<td id="S8.T6.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;"><span id="S8.T6.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">Value</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S8.T6.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S8.T6.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;"><span id="S8.T6.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Actor Architecture</span></th>
